  "summary": "判断数组中是否存在长度 m 的模式连续重复至少 k 次。",
  "insight": "枚举重复块起点 start，只需验证后续 m(k-1) 个元素是否等于向前 m 位的元素。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "重复必须连续",
    "起点最大为 n-mk",
    "k 为一时任何长度 m 片段都满足"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "start-and-offset-check",
      "title": "起点与周期偏移检查",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "直接验证候选区间具有周期 m。",
      "steps": [
        "required=m*k",
        "start 从零到 n-required",
        "offset 从 m 到 required-1，若 arr[start+offset]!=arr[start+offset-m] 则失败；全相等返回 true"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(nmk)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/start-and-offset-check/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/start-and-offset-check/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/start-and-offset-check/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
